                "entry_id": "6043ece2-2045-3695-8be4-a29e31062dfd",
                "word": "tankie",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "62d61aea-51d9-4b00-b140-4eceff9eaa62",
                        "entry_id": "6043ece2-2045-3695-8be4-a29e31062dfd",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "tankies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5e96d940-254b-3838-a92d-3a28152a2e13",
                        "entry_id": "6043ece2-2045-3695-8be4-a29e31062dfd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est partisan·e des politiques de pays communistes (tels que l’URSS, la Chine ou la Corée du Nord) ou à héritage socialiste (tels que la Biélorussie, Cuba, la Syrie ou la Russie) qui sont décrits comme autoritaires par leurs détracteurs·ices."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2557159-5ee3-476e-bb33-a1525c7f25ba",
                                "sense_id": "5e96d940-254b-3838-a92d-3a28152a2e13",
                                "text": "La décompisition morale avancée de la gauche tankie\nQualifier Poutine d'impérialisme, c'est faire preuve de russophobie selon Michel Seymour.\nSeymour est un pro-Poutine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aeecbb12-bbe1-4ce9-a87a-5f0bb8e49c3b",
                                "sense_id": "5e96d940-254b-3838-a92d-3a28152a2e13",
                                "text": "Alors ça tombe bien parce que la FI est pas tankie + tu mélanges tout c'est incr"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "958e0226-cf5a-4db0-bf2b-0efdb94acee5",
                                "sense_id": "5e96d940-254b-3838-a92d-3a28152a2e13",
                                "text": "meme si l'intention est louable , ca reste un parti tankie qui refuse de condamner l'invasion russe en ukraine , il ont pas mont soutien ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5189e705-43b7-4b02-b4ff-8232de57323f",
                                "sense_id": "5e96d940-254b-3838-a92d-3a28152a2e13",
                                "text": "Champion catégorie tankie français. Le type chasse encore les \"fils de russe blanc\" en 2022. Il doit s'imaginer que Poutine dirige l'Internationale des travailleurs et lutte contre la bourgeoisie ?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ed7d64a6-131a-42ca-8cb4-786cc1d1f312",
                        "source_entry_id": "6043ece2-2045-3695-8be4-a29e31062dfd",
                        "source_sense_id": "5e96d940-254b-3838-a92d-3a28152a2e13",
                        "target_lang_word": "tankie",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tankie",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b92f7176-c964-3a56-8d3e-50001137ca81",
                                        "entry_id": "c8444f77-7612-327f-978e-442736c1135c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of the Communist Party of Great Britain who supported the Soviet Union's policy of crushing revolts in Hungary in the 1950s and Czechoslovakia in the 1960s by sending tanks into those countries."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "historical",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ec0f5ed-f8bb-436b-9854-9e8e8ef60480",
                                                "sense_id": "b92f7176-c964-3a56-8d3e-50001137ca81",
                                                "text": "[W]e also desired to shock the staid older party members and the tankies. The tankies and softliners differed as to what sort of magazine Challenge should be."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7e6e632-6fee-4e72-ac6d-1e408a48db54",
                                                "sense_id": "b92f7176-c964-3a56-8d3e-50001137ca81",
                                                "text": "Stephen Well, read the Morning Star and keep up with the tankies. / Max The tankies … How the years roll by. Dubcek is back. Russia agrees to withdraw its garrisons. Czechoslovakia takes her knickers off to welcome capitalism. And all that remains of August '68 is a derisive nickname for the only real Communists left in the Communist Party. I'm exactly as old as the October Revolution …"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc5a8ead-7746-4cbc-82b6-b1b4f0ac2221",
                                                "sense_id": "b92f7176-c964-3a56-8d3e-50001137ca81",
                                                "text": "[T]he tankies, those members of the British Communist Party who unquestioningly followed Moscow's line, up to and beyond supporting Soviet tanks rumbling through the streets of Budapest and Prague, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92463a8f-5104-3cc4-813b-6b74e9fa8ac9",
                                        "entry_id": "c8444f77-7612-327f-978e-442736c1135c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A supporter of policies and actions by the Soviet Union, China, Cuba or other authoritarian socialist (chiefly Marxist-Leninist) governments."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4e16404-f070-42e4-821f-334cf1de3356",
                                                "sense_id": "92463a8f-5104-3cc4-813b-6b74e9fa8ac9",
                                                "text": "As far as the Sparklies were concerned the new comics were scruffy herberts who shouted ‘Fuck Thatcher’ over and over, while raving Tankie Stalinists hooted indiscriminately in the front row."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27344862-8e56-4a72-9954-ed482bcc4764",
                                                "sense_id": "92463a8f-5104-3cc4-813b-6b74e9fa8ac9",
                                                "text": "Though in an age in which anyone can publish texts, images, and videos to potentially huge audiences and in which impassioned leftists of “woke,” “tankie,” and “democratic-socialist” (post-Corbynista or Bernie Bro) persuasions post constant calls to action, informational posts, and manifestos, the failure of the left to ignite needs further analysis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ad04046-c52e-3a55-b74f-0ce64255aaf4",
                                        "entry_id": "c8444f77-7612-327f-978e-442736c1135c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A soldier from a tank regiment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea7e45eb-dd1a-47a5-a27d-50dacfc53b1b",
                                                "sense_id": "0ad04046-c52e-3a55-b74f-0ce64255aaf4",
                                                "text": "Obviously a thrust by the tankies over the ridge and through the minefield was just not on, there and then in broad daylight, a fact they appeared to recognise. At that stage the Germans were well positioned to give them a warm reception with their powerful 88s and other artillery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7571099-07c2-47cd-8db7-53211f7d5dcf",
                                                "sense_id": "0ad04046-c52e-3a55-b74f-0ce64255aaf4",
                                                "text": "Breakfast was taken alongside a curious tank without a turret. When I asked about it a tankie sergeant said, 'It's a Kangaroo: that's a Sherman without a turret. The Canadians make them.[…]'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "461e4418-5549-4267-aad3-1d057aedab2b",
                                                "sense_id": "0ad04046-c52e-3a55-b74f-0ce64255aaf4",
                                                "text": "Caine focused on the RTR [Royal Tank Regiment] badge directly above Glenn's left eye. 'Never had you down as a tankie, sir,' he said. 'Always thought you were a greenjacket through and through.' Glenn snorted. 'I'm no more a tankie than you are,' he said, curling back dry lips to show the slablike teeth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79f22f9c-79fd-3b9f-b239-1d937ded7550",
                                        "entry_id": "c8444f77-7612-327f-978e-442736c1135c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tank engine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4057ab47-73bd-46e6-9e70-415db35f9bfe",
                                                "sense_id": "79f22f9c-79fd-3b9f-b239-1d937ded7550",
                                                "text": "The \"tankies\", as they were known, shunted empty carriages from Copley Hill sidings onto the buffers at Leeds […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "tankie",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "665e3879-3e9d-3436-a6b1-7e9490937fa5",
